{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0100"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge film-media/tv","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/film-media__tv.g1.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",266],["-","the"],["+","The"],["=",1],["-","fictional"],["+","New"],["=",1],["-","*New "],["=",2],["-","Star*,"],["+","Star,"],["=",1],["+","a fictional newspaper, "],["=",570],["+","Carrie's long parade of dates also served as a showcase for actors who were not yet famous. In 1999, in the second season, a young Bradley Cooper made his television debut as one of the men Carrie goes out with — years before \"The Hangover\", \"Silver Linings Playbook\" and \"A Star Is Born\" brought him a string of Oscar nominations.\n\n"],["=",161]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",230],["-","den"],["+","die"],["=",1],["-","fiktiven"],["+","fiktive"],["=",1],["-","*New"],["+","Zeitung"],["=",1],["+","The New "],["=",2],["-","Star*"],["+","Star"],["=",581],["+","Carries lange Reihe von Verabredungen war zugleich ein Schaufenster für Schauspieler, die noch nicht berühmt waren. 1999, in der zweiten Staffel, gab ein junger Bradley Cooper sein Fernsehdebüt als einer der Männer, mit denen Carrie ausgeht — Jahre bevor ihm „Hangover“, „Silver Linings“ und „A Star Is Born“ eine ganze Reihe von Oscarnominierungen einbrachten.\n\n"],["=",159]]}]},
